### Hours - Create
POST http://localhost:3002/hours
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-02-21",
  "entryTime": "2026-02-21T08:00:00.000Z",
  "exitTime": "2026-02-21T16:00:00.000Z"
}

